surname>Cross</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dutt</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Histological audit of acute appendicitis</article-title><source>J Clin Pathol</source><year>1992</year><volume>45</volume><fpage>456</fpage><lpage>458</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1597528</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jcp.45.5.456</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arca</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gates</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Groner</surname><given-names>JI</given-names></name><name><surname>Hammond</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Caniano</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical manifestations of appendiceal pinworms in children: an institutional experience and a review of the literature</article-title><source>Pediatr Surg Int</source><year>2004</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>372</fpage><lpage>375</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15141320</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00383-004-1151-5</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>